WEBVTT

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.510
Passing Time

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:54.780
Let's see, 135 over 80.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.120
Not bad, Someji.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.410
All right.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.290
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.580
Your blood pressure has gone down quite a bit.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.630
But I'm going to give you more medicine.
Keep taking it.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.380
Sure thing. Lay it on me!

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.340
About three months' worth.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:23.180
SAKUMA, MD
Internal Medicine
Pediatrics

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.010
Idiot, I can't give you that much.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:19.430
Three weeks' worth.
Come back again next month for more.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:23.180
Feh. All right, fine. Guess I'll see you then.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.940
But you really have changed, Someji.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:31.310
A long time ago, you were like,
"I'm not counting on any doctor!"

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:36.070
You used to say, "I'll live how I want to,
and die whenever!"

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:43.200
Well, my wife and daughter
left me with three little ones.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.160
For them, I'm all they have.

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:55.090
Come hell or high water, I have to stay alive
until all three of them are married off.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:05.850
No way can I let them stand in front of
that gold leaf folding screen alone.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:08.640
Someji...

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.770
But still...

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:19.950
With Momo, it'd help me out
if she got married as soon as possible.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.700
HMMM

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.700
The youngest, huh? How old is she again?

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.330
SQUEEE

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.700
MUD BALLS

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.660
PRESCHOOLER

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.880
She's still in preschool.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.670
If she got married just after 20, I'd be...

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.170
in my mid-90s?!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.640
I'm sorry, Someji.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.930
I can't look after you for that long.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.520
Five more days until the entrance exam.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.860
I'm so nervous!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.070
GROAN

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.070
ARGH

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:08.080
AOWWW

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:08.080
MEOWWW

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:08.080
The anxiety is spreading

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.080
Got hooked in,
and crying as well

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.460
You've done everything you could.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:14.580
Even your weakest area, proof problems,
you got up to an average score of 80 or higher.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.500
So you'll be fine.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.590
Now we should just
review everything thoroughly.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:25.720
And if there's anything you're still unsure of,
we'll practice it again with a worksheet.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.230
Oh, that's right.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.140
Takahashi said

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:36.230
he's going to a private school in Kouchi, Shikoku,
thanks to a recommendation, huh?

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:47.740
Huh?

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.370
Hina, you didn't...

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.670
In Shikoku?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:05.180
<i>When I saw her surprised face,
which looked like that of a young child,</i>

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.220
<i>It felt like I had...</i>

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.940
<i>broken a small egg.</i>

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:25.530
I'd heard he was going to the high school
affiliated with Meitei University.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.990
That's what he said before.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.330
So...

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.290
Shikoku?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.760
That's so far away.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:03.610
<i>I thought she already knew about it.</i>

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.200
<i>I wish I'd never said anything.</i>

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.950
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.330
<i>With the exam just days away...</i>

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.880
<i>And she worked so hard for this, too.</i>

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.220
<i>I made her feel so terrible.</i>

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.720
<i>But she only feels this way because...</i>

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:38.690
<i>it's Takahashi, after all.</i>

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:47.490
Oh, Hina, are you out grocery shopping?
That's wonderful.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:50.620
Hello, Mrs. Yamada.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:56.750
TSUKUDANI

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.460
<i>It hasn't changed since I was a kid.</i>

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.250
<i>My town.</i>

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:02.250
YAMADA STORE

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.250
<i>The scenery of the neighborhood...</i>

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.510
Drink Milk to Be Healthy
Takahashi Milk

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:09.260
<i>And at the edge of the shopping district...</i>

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.760
Hokkaido
Milk Pudding

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.020
I smell curry.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:27.280
<i>I see. Takahashi's family
is having curry for dinner tonight.</i>

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.990
<i>I bet he'll be happy about that.</i>

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.790
<i>After all, Takahashi loves curry.</i>

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.790
<i>Kawamoto, your curry is awesome!</i>

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.970
<i>Shikoku, huh?</i>

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.480
<i>That's far from here.</i>

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:05.150
<i>And Chiho in Iwate is far from here.</i>

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.820
<i>Mom, Grandma...</i>

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.620
<i>and Dad, too.</i>

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.830
<i>It's always like that.</i>

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:24.380
<i>I take it for granted that tomorrow
will come like it always does...</i>

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:29.380
<i>and that I'll always be able to see everyone.</i>

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.970
<i>But then I get a surprise.</i>

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:40.480
<i>Just like this, time after time...</i>

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:53.200
Kiriyama, are you sure you don't mind?

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:59.080
It's fine. I'll stay here until you get back, Akari.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:03.250
Besides, you helped me so much last year.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.340
I'm sorry. There's suddenly a party
at my aunt's pub.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.460
Momo's going to stay over at Grandpa's place!

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:13.220
I'll come back as soon as I can.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:14.760
Okay.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.360
What should I do?

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:37.240
The entrance exam is the day after tomorrow
and I'm like this.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:42.080
You'll be fine. You studied plenty.

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:47.000
Now you just need to rest up
and recuperate as much as possible.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.500
What'll I do if the fever doesn't go down?

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.420
What if...

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.890
I forget everything I've learned?

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:01.100
You won't forget.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.100
It'll be okay.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:10.520
In a little while, you can have some porridge,
and then let's take some medicine.

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.530
Until then, get some sleep.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.200
Okay.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:21.830
Well, it's easier to sleep if it's dark,
so I'll close the door.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:23.870
Okay.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:27.120
Call me if you need anything.

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.790
I'll be right next door.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.670
Okay.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.070
<i>And by the morning of the exam,</i>

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:02.240
<i>her fever had dropped considerably,
to just over 37 degrees.</i>

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:06.080
Hina! Kiriyama has come to pick you up!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.080
What, Rei?

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.830
You didn't have to go to the trouble.
I'll be okay!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.960
Well, it's my day off anyway.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.630
From school?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:19.720
Well, you and the other exam-takers
will be there, so we don't have class today.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.220
Oh, that's right.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.220
Hina, good luck!

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:24.930
See you later!

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.350
Be careful of the snow. Don't fail—

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:28.980
EEK

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.020
I-I mean, don't trip.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:34.480
Right! See you later!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.030
<i>During the time I had the fever,</i>

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:49.160
<i>I kept thinking about all the people I had lost...</i>

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:53.380
<i>and the tears wouldn't stop.</i>

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.380
I'll hold your bag.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.050
That's okay. I've got it.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:03.600
The sidewalk's iced up,
so it could be dangerous. Here.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.770
Thanks.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:20.900
Kiriyama, you're kind of like a mother.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.160
What?

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:27.700
I feel like someone told me that before.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.910
<i>But...</i>

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:46.300
<i>But that's right.
Rei suddenly appeared before me.</i>

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:03.150
Mom, Grandma, please watch over Hina.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.950
CRESCENT MOON

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.210
Good luck, Hina.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.340
Hina! Are you all right?!

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.260
You fell—

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.390
No, um, I mean...

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.060
I'm fine! I-I just tripped!

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:33.230
<i>That's right.</i>

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.690
<i>Not everyone has gone far away.</i>

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:40.030
<i>Not everyone has disappeared.</i>

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:45.990
<i>I mustn't ever forget that.</i>

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.040
Passing Time

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:57.040
Spring Comes

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:02.300
QUIVER
QUIVER

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:04.800
Wow!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:09.140
SIZZLE

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:09.140
PIPING HOT

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.140
Heap of Juicy
Deep-Fried Chicken

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.640
Eggplant and Meat Gratin
with Plenty of Cheese

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.140
Tuna and Soft Boiled Egg
Macaroni Salad

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.640
Garlic Toast

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.150
Mini Onigiri
and Sweet Pickled Daikon Radish

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:21.900
Hina, congratulations on passing!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.530
CELEBRATE

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.610
I-It's like a mountain of fried meat!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:26.950
MOUNTAIN

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:31.200
It's juicy!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.700
HUFF
HUFF

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.040
Grabbing it
with her
hands

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.040
And the eggplant gratin!

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.880
I'm so happy!
Look at all this cheese!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.210
A huge pile of macaroni salad!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.550
With lots of tuna and soft boiled eggs!

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:47.050
HUFF
HUFF

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.050
What do you think?
I made all your favorites, Hina.

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:48.260
HOHOHO

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.140
It's really delicious!

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:53.140
All right, everyone, fill up!

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.480
For tonight, fried foods are the beverages.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:59.270
Since we're celebrating, I got carried away
and deep-fried two kilograms of chicken.

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.860
T-Two kilos?! As beverages?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.570
Akari, wait...

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.940
Hina, congratulations!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.900
Thank you, Momo!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:11.320
I'm moving up too,
to senior year of preschool!

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:13.490
Really, now...

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:18.580
My little Hina is becoming
a high school student.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.670
Time sure flies.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.340
I'm getting old.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.590
No, Akari, knock it off! No mom-speak.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.930
You're still only 23!

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:33.390
But it's really all thanks to Rei.

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:37.430
Because you helped me with math,
I was able to solve a lot of mysteries!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.440
Like proof problems!

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:45.610
True, your average math score has gone up
30 points since Rei started tutoring you.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:48.030
Even though you really didn't like math!

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:50.200
Whoa, that's impressive, kid!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.320
I guess professional shogi players
are smart cookies.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.330
Thank you so much. Can I call you Rei too?

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:58.830
Eat some more.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.330
Keep eating!

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:05.090
Uh, th-thank you.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:05.090
HEAP

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.460
The Night Before the Exam
(Flash Back)

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.720
EHH!?

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.720
RATTLE

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.720
Y-You left the two of them alone in the house?

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.600
Kiriyama is that boy who's always over, right?
How old is he now?

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:16.470
A second-year?

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:21.270
You left a third-year middle schooler and a
second-year high schooler home alone this late?

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.560
Wh-What will you do if something happens?

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.690
If they make a mistake, it'll be too late!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.610
You need to go home right now!

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:30.740
Wh-What'll we do
if something happens to Hina?

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:35.830
Calm down, it's all right, Aunt.
There's nothing to worry about.

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.490
It's all right?!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.700
How can you be so blasé?

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:41.330
Well...

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.210
We're talking about Kiriyama.

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:50.970
The Next Day From There
(Flashback 2)

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:50.970
CRESCENT MOON

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:52.220
Hey, Dad, are you okay with this?

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.430
No matter how well-behaved he is
or that he's helping her study,

00:16:55.680 --> 00:17:00.310
I can't believe you're letting a young animal
have the run of an all-female house.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:02.940
What's this, all of a sudden?

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:05.650
What'll we do if something happens to Hina?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.570
It's fine.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:12.320
After all, we're talking about the kid!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:17.330
Nothing, nothing's going to happen.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:21.580
<i>Not only Akari, but Dad too!</i>

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.710
<i>They fully trust a second-year high school boy?</i>

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.840
<i>Does he really such a safety piece?</i>

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:31.970
<i>I worry about the future.
I mean, I have doubts about boys these days.</i>

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:37.510
Go on, eat. This and this too!
Really, thank you so much!

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.510
SYMPATHY

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:39.100
Thank you.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:46.350
<i>Pet me, pet me, pet me right now!</i>

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:49.980
Rei, I'm looking forward to April.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.900
Me too.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:59.910
Noguchi and the other members
of the Shogi Science Club are graduating,

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.540
so I'm happy that you're coming
to my school.

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:07.040
And for some reason,
Mr. Hayashida is thrilled about it too.

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:07.880
Really?

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:10.460
That's the teacher I met
with the flume noodles, right?

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.880
That makes me so happy!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.630
<i>Yes! Here it comes! Yes!</i>

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:16.890
<i>Mr. Hayashida?</i>

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:22.810
I really don't know how to thank you, Rei.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:27.060
Even though you had
a lot of your own work to do,

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.400
you came here several times a week.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.690
Don't worry. I was studying here, too.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.660
<i>Besides, I was incredibly careful.</i>

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:44.660
<i>If I got bad results,
she would've thought it was her fault,</i>

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.960
<i>so I played each and every match
as carefully as possible.</i>

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:54.210
<i>It was a different way of facing things
than I've done up to now.</i>

00:18:56.170 --> 00:19:00.300
Kid, you have about two more
rank-deciding competitions for this period?

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:03.180
Yes. Right now I have eight wins.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:07.810
E-Eight wins in a row?
So you’ll go up a class? To B-2?!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:11.060
Yes. Unless something really bad happens.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:14.280
You say it so matter-of-factly.

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:20.320
Hina, he's fine!
In that world, the kid is as terrifying as an ogre!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.830
<i>Oh man, this guy is scary!</i>

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.750
Ogre? Rei?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:31.420
Go up a class?
That's a great thing, right?

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:35.510
Um, uh, thank goodness!

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:42.180
Hina, more juice, please.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.470
Juice? What kind?

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:50.600
- Cola!
- You're too young for cola.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:51.020
<i>I hate to see her cry
or be troubled about something.</i>

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.060
Then orange!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:55.400
Okay, hold on. Hup!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:57.190
<i>I can't stand the idea of her being in trouble
with me not knowing about it.</i>

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:04.740
<i>So when I heard she wanted to come to a place
that was within my reach,</i>

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:07.040
<i>I wanted to make sure she was accepted.</i>

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:15.170
<i>Until then, I thought that whether
what I did was right or wrong</i>

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.920
<i>was something that other people
would decide, as if in a trial.</i>

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:24.640
<i>But that one day...</i>

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:42.910
<i>when she said, "I didn't do anything wrong,"</i>

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:45.200
<i>and while filled with anxiety,</i>

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:51.210
<i>she still kept a firm grip
on the helm of her heart.</i>

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.760
<i>I found...</i>

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:12.690
<i>a light within myself that I didn't have before.</i>

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.490
<i>That's right.</i>

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.660
<i>Without a doubt,</i>

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:32.210
SHOGI HALL

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:38.170
<i>on that day,</i>

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:40.710
<i>she has made...</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:44.970
<i>a part of me.</i>

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:01.190
Rei.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.740
Father.

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:17.000
I won today, so I barely managed
to avoid a demotion.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.250
Looks like I'll be in B-2 next period.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.760
Maybe we can pick up
where we left off last time.

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:30.140
Rei.

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:48.740
That's right, Father.

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:00.040
Spring Comes

00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:32.010
Next Episode Preview

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:37.390
Episode 44

00:24:32.430 --> 00:24:34.260
Both of you, congratulations
on your graduation.

00:24:34.260 --> 00:24:35.970
Wait a second.

00:24:35.970 --> 00:24:37.390
When are you leaving?

00:24:37.390 --> 00:24:38.930
Shall we go?

00:24:38.930 --> 00:24:41.060
Hina! Here!

00:24:41.190 --> 00:24:43.230
I'm going to do my best here, too.

00:24:43.230 --> 00:24:46.020
My little sister is too cute!

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:48.230
I messed up.

00:24:48.230 --> 00:24:50.030
I'm never leaving the house again.

00:24:50.030 --> 00:24:59.040
ILLUSTRATION:
CHUUYA KOYAMA

00:24:50.030 --> 00:24:59.040
SHOGI HALL

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:54.820
It's almost spring, so I'll be
a high school student, huh?

00:24:54.820 --> 00:24:57.910
I'm looking forward to being
in the same school as Rei.
